## 7. State Transition Matrix

### Complete Transition Table

| Current | Event | Next | Actor | Condition |
|---------|-------|------|-------|-----------|
| — | create | OPEN | system | N=3 consecutive detections |
| OPEN | acknowledge | ACKNOWLEDGED | user | — |
| OPEN | condition_clear | RESOLVED | system | M=5 consecutive OK |
| ACKNOWLEDGED | condition_clear | RESOLVED | system | M=5 consecutive OK |
| ACKNOWLEDGED | condition_persist | ACKNOWLEDGED | system | condition still present |
| RESOLVED | condition_reappeared | OPEN | system | new detection (N=3) |

### Transition Semantics

**OPEN → ACKNOWLEDGED:**
- **Actor:** user (manual)
- **Trigger:** API call `POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/acknowledge`
- **Side effect:** `acknowledged_at`, `acknowledged_by` 기록

**OPEN → RESOLVED:**
- **Actor:** system (automatic)
- **Trigger:** M=5 consecutive OK observations
- **Side effect:** `resolved_at`, `resolution_note = "condition_cleared"`

**ACKNOWLEDGED → RESOLVED:**
- **Actor:** system (automatic)
- **Trigger:** M=5 consecutive OK observations
- **Side effect:** `resolved_at`, `resolution_note = "condition_cleared"`

**RESOLVED → OPEN:**
- **Actor:** system (automatic)
- **Trigger:** 동일 fingerprint 가 N=3 연속 감지
- **Side effect:** **새 Alert 생성** (기존 Alert 재사용 안 함)

