## 10. Fingerprint Purpose

**Goal:**
> 동일한 장애가 반복 collection 될 때 동일 Alert 로 식별 (deduplication)

**Example:**
```
Collection #1: Storage Controller 1 FAILED
Collection #2: Storage Controller 1 FAILED
Collection #3: Storage Controller 1 FAILED
→ 1 active Alert (not 3)
```

