## 13. Hash Algorithm

### Algorithm Selection

| Algorithm | Hash Length | Security | Performance | Recommendation |
|-----------|-------------|----------|-------------|----------------|
| SHA-256 | 64 hex | High | Good | ✅ RECOMMENDED |
| SHA-1 | 40 hex | Weak | Good | ⚠️ Not recommended |
| MD5 | 32 hex | Broken | Fast | ❌ Avoid |

**DESIGN DECISION: SHA-256**

**Rationale:**
- Security 목적이 아니지만, collision resistance 중요
- Python standard library (`hashlib`) 에서 지원
- 64 hex characters = DB index 에 적합

### Output Representation

```python
fingerprint: str  # 64-character hex string
```

